  "name": "Inversion Prism",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Price</strong> 75 gp; <strong>Weight</strong> –</p>\n<p>This wavy, translucent prism of glass-like stone seems to block light coming in from one side, but not the other. Its energies like the sparse portals which exist between positive and negative- aligned planes.</p>\n<p><strong>Power Component</strong><br>\n<strong>Doses</strong> 1 (75 gp); <strong>Focus</strong> 30 (2,250 gp); <strong>Spells</strong> dark or light spells</p>\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> When you use an inversion prism as a material component or focus for a spell or sphere effect with the dark or light descriptor, increase the DC of that spell or sphere effect’s saving throws by +1.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/equipment#toc10\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
